  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance multisectorielle d&#x2019;urgence aux populations vuln&#xe9;rables dans le Nord-Kivu (coordination et gestion de sites de d&#xe9;placement et articles non alimentaires)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide camp coordination and camp management services and deliver life-saving shelter and essential household item assistance to internally displaced persons in Goma and Nyiragongo. This IOM project provides essential camp management services and distributes essential household item kits. This project provides humanitarian assistance to 28,150 people, including 7,000 women, 4,200 men, 16,950 children, and including 960 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
